abstract: >-
  Python framework for coherent-pattern analysis on graph-coupled networks.
  The engine implements a nodal evolution interface, 13 registered structural
  operators, grammar validation and four structural diagnostic fields.
  Mathematical results have explicit model and representation assumptions;
  auxiliary constructions and finite tests do not establish physical emergence
  or a general stability theorem. This release integrates audited nodal research,
  corrected documentation and reproducible validation tools.
